            "sid": "JOS 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseka dayisakwililuwu anyana kaYosefu nachinjikijilu, dafumini kuYodana kuYeriku, kumeji akuYeriku akumusela, kuŋawu, dafumini kuYeriku nakuhanuka mwituŋa damapidi lusu nikuBcteli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dafumini kuBeteli nakuya kuLuzi, hiwukuhita, nikuŋinza yawaArakiti wuya nikuAtaroti; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dakunkumukili nakuya kumujika nikuŋinza yawaYafweleti, nikuŋinza yaBetihoroni wakunkulu, ndo nikuGezeri; kuwakuminini kwokukaluŋalwiji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaYosefu, aManase naEfweremi, atambwili wuswana wawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu ŋinza yawanyana kaEfweremi mwahita yisaka yawu; ŋinza yawuswana wawu kumusela yadiŋi Ataroti Adara, ndo nikuBetihoroni wakundundamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋinza kumujika yedikilili kuMikimetata kukabeta kakuchimunswa; ŋinza yibalumuka nikubalumuka hiyikuya nikumusela kuTayanati Shili, hiyikukulisha Yanowa okuma kumujika; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yafumini kuYanowa nakukunkumuka nikuAtaroti, nikuNayara, yishika nikuYeriku, yiidika nikuYodana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kufumisha kuTapuwa ŋinza yahitili kumujika nikukakaloŋa yowu Kana; kuyakumini kwoku kukaluŋalwiji. Weniwu diwu wuswana wamuchidi wawanyana kaEfweremi, mwahita yisaka yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubombelaku ninyikala yambwililuwu anyana kaEfweremi mukachi kawuswana wawanyana kaManase, nyikala yamaneni yejima ninyikala yayu yanyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyayitemwini aKenani ashakamini muGezeruku, ilaŋa aKenani ashakama mukachi kaEfweremi nikulelu, elili aŋamba akuyikogela nyiaimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
